{% comment %}
  CRO-12473 — A2 "Oor hierdie produk" long-description section.
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  The buy box's description block is NOT in the cro-12473 template's
  block_order — the description renders here instead, full-width,
  directly after the main product section (this section sits second in
  the template's section order). This is the lever that lifts
  Add-to-cart onto the first screen on mobile.

  Per client decision (Donavan, Slack 2026-08-06): the FULL description
  renders here completely unmodified — nothing is removed or split. The
  buy box shows a 150-char plain-text teaser whose "Lees meer" link
  anchors to #cro-12473-description on the inner wrapper below
  (scroll-margin/smooth-scroll live in cro-12473-pdp.css).
{% endcomment %}

{% if product.description != blank %}
  <div class="cro-12473-desc-inner" id="cro-12473-description">
    <h2 class="cro-12473-desc-title">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
    <div class="product-description rte cro-12473-desc-body" data-cro-12473-description>
      {{ product.description }}
    </div>
  </div>
{% endif %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "CRO-12473 Description",
  "class": "cro-12473-desc-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Section heading",
      "default": "Oor hierdie produk"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
